Explanation of MIDI Test Data
Chris Ahlstrom
2026-11-10 to 2026-11-10

[app] Read MIDI file PPQN 192: 'tests/data/midi/smoke.mid'

The data below shows the contents of that MIDI file. For better testing
(more test values) the output was modified to change the time-stamps
and channels to create 'tests/data/midi/smoke.transcript'.

When the spectest application is run, 'smoke.transcript' is
read and then used to regenerate 'smoke-2.transcript'. Both
are identical if the test succeeds.

